WEBVTT

00:15:28.875 --> 00:15:32.768
all we have to do is choose to have it.

00:15:32.792 --> 00:15:34.059
Thank you.

00:15:34.083 --> 00:15:39.042
(Applause)

00:15:51.708 --> 00:15:54.875
Moderator: So Nick,
I'm sure you get this question a lot.

00:15:56.333 --> 00:15:59.434
If you're so unhappy
with the economic system,

00:15:59.458 --> 00:16:04.184
why not just give all your money away
and join the 99 percent?